config SPRD_WLAN_COMBO
	tristate "Unisoc SC2355 combo WLAN driver (sprdwl family)"
	depends on MAC80211 || CFG80211
	help
	  Unisoc SC2355 (Marlin3) WLAN driver, the sprdwl_ng family, ported
	  from the vendor 5.4 source (as kept alive by the mu300-linux
	  mainline port). Builds sprd_wlan_combo.ko; load it after the WCN
	  bus (marlin/sdiohal) is up. Say M.
